subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

Renew a subscription

USAGE:
  subtrack renew <OPTIONS> <id>

ARGUMENTS:
  id           

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help                           Display this help message
  -v, --version                        Display this version
  --price <price>                      
  --currency <currency>                
  --cycle <cycle>                      
  --contractEnd <contractEnd>          
  --planTier <planTier>                
  --autoRenewal                        

